      <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 08:00:00 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>https://christerbeke.com/projects/homey-remeha/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/ChrisTerBeke/homey-remeha&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Homey Remeha Home App&lt;/a&gt; adds support for &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.remeha.nl/product/etwist-app-vernieuwd&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Remeha Home&lt;/a&gt; to &lt;a href=&#34;https://homey.app/en-us/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Homey&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;This allows you to monitor and control your Remeha thermostat, heat pump or gas boiler.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
